       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.          TCSASTRN.
       AUTHOR.              C.I.HILLES.
       DATE-WRITTEN.        3/27/91.
       DATE-COMPILED.
      *INSTALLATION.        GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER - AKRON.
      *SECURITY.
      *D   REMARKS.
      *D
      *D   FLEXIBLE REPORT OF DTRANS DATASET IN THE CSACCT DATABASE.   R
      *D   CAN HAVE MANY SELECT AND SORT OPTIONS.  REPLACES THE
      *D   INVOICE BY CLASS REPORT.
      *D
      *C   07/08/1992          DAVE PLUM            REQUEST #6067
      *C   ADDED THE FOLLOWING 2 ENHANCEMENTS WHICH HAD PREVIOUSLY
      *C   BEEN ADDED TO THE HP-3000 VERSION OF THIS PROGRAM:
      *C   1) REVERSE THE SIGN (MULTIPLY BE -1) OF VALUE FIELD FOR
      *C      REPORTING PURPOSES FOR THE FOLLOWING TRANSACTIONS:
      *C      RET, RETV, AADJ, AND SADJ
      *C   2) REPLACE THE EMPLOYEE/CARRIER VALUE OF "CANC" (CANCELLED)
      *C      WITH THE ORIGINAL CARRIER ON "FRT" RECORDS.  THIS IS
      *C      ATTEMPTED BY READING THE DATASET DAPPLFRT USING
      *C      PRO NUMBER (DOCUMENT NUMBER FIELD IN DTRANS).  THIS
      *C      CHANGE ASSISTS THOSE USERS WHICH ATTEMPT TO BALANCE THE
      *C      FREIGHT STATUS REPORT TO A CSAS TRANSACTIONS REPORT OF
      *C      ALL "FRT" ENTRIES SORTED BY CARRIER CODE.  THESE
      *C      "CANCELLED FREIGHT" ENTRIES ON THIS REPORT WILL ALSO BE
      *C      FLAGGED WITH AN "*" TO INDICATE THEIR CANCELLED STATUS.
      *C   COMPLETED THESE CHANGES ON 7/20/1992.
      *C
      *C   07/13/93            DAVE PLUM
      *C   REVISED THIS PROGRAM TO CONFORM TO THE CHANGES MADE IN THE
      *C   OVERHAUL OF THE FREIGHT ACCOUNTING APPLICATION INCLUDING:
      *C      - NEW DAPPLFRT DATASET FORMAT
      *C      - ELIMINATION OF DTRANS "FRT" ENTRIES WITH "CANC" AS THE
      *C        EMPLOYEE/CARRIER
      *C
      *C   07FEB1994    DAVE PLUM
      *C     ADDED CALL TO THE COBOL ERROR HANDLER - MCXCBLERR.
      *C
      *C   FEB 28, 1994  CR KALMAN  REQUEST #6477
      *C   CHANGED SCREEN TO ALLOW USER TO TO REQUEST THAT KEYWORD
      *C   AND MODIFIER APPEAR ON REPORT. THE CODE FOR THIS ALREADY
      *C   EXISTED BUT THE USER HAD NO WAY TO REQUEST IT.
      *C
      *C   APR 24, 1995  CA ZUBEK   REQUEST #95-014
      *C   ADDED LOGIC AND FIELDS TO ALLOW PRINTING A REPORT THAT
      *C   INCLUDES TRANSACTIONS FROM THE CURRENT MONTH AND THE
      *C   PREVIOUS MONTH.  ALSO ADDED THE CAPABILITY TO SPECIFY
      *C   EIGHT MORE DEPARTMENTS FOR THE REPORT.
      *C
      *C   JUNE 6, 1995  CA YODER   REQUEST #95-014
      *C   MADE THE FOLLOWING CHANGES FOR PHASE 2 OF THIS REQUEST:
      *C     1.  COPIED THE SCREEN "FCSASTRN" IN "ZRSCREEN" TO A NEW
      *C         SCREEN CALLED "FCSASTRB" TO SHOW THE DEFAULTS REQUESTED
      *C         BY LAWTON.  ** N O T E:  IF A CHANGE IS MADE TO EITHER
      *C         ONE OF THESE SCREENS, MAKE SURE TO MAKE THE CHANGE TO
      *C         THE OTHER ONE ALSO.
      *C     2.  ADDED A TABLE AND FIELDS TO KEEP TRACK OF SUBTOTALS BY
      *C         ACCOUNT NUMBER FOR THE SUMMARY REPORT (ONLY FOR OPTION
      *C         10).  ADDED LOGIC TO PRINT THIS REPORT AFTER THE DETAIL
      *C         REPORT.
      *C     3.  ADDED HIDDEN FIELD TO "FCSASTRN" AND "FCSASTRB" TO PRINT
      *C         THE CHARACTER "Z" ON THE SECOND OUTPUT RECORD (INPUT FOR
      *C         THIS PROGRAM) SO THE RECORD WILL BE WRITTEN EVEN IF NO
      *C         DEPARTMENT IS ENTERED ON THE SCREEN.  (THE "Z" IS IN
      *C         THE FIRST POSITION OF THE FILLER.)
      *C
      *C   JULY 19, 1995  CA YODER
      *C   ADDED AN ADDITIONAL CHECK IN THE SUMMARY REPORT TABLE LOGIC TO
      *C   MAKE SURE A HOLD FIELD IS MOVED PROPERLY.  (LAWTON REPORTED A
      *C   A PROBLEM WITH THE CLASS 250 TOTALS.)
      *C
      *C   15AUG1995   DAVE PLUM
      *C     REVISED THE DTRANS2 LOGIC TO HANDLE THE CASE WHERE THERE ARE
      *C     EXACTLY ZERO RECORDS IN THE DTRANS2 FILE.
      *C
      *C   10APR1996   DAVE PLUM
      *C     REVISED THE WAY THE PROGRAM HANDLES THE INCLUDE-PREV-MTH
      *C     VARIABLE.  THIS FIELD WILL NOW BE SET TO "X" WHEN THE USER
      *C     HAS SPECIFIED A DATE RANGE, INSTEAD OF DEFAULTING TO SPACES.
      *C     BY SETTING THIS FIELD TO "X" WHEN A USER REQUESTS A
      *C     SPECIFIC DATE RANGE, THE USER WILL GET ALL OF THE RECORDS
      *C     WHICH FALL WITHIN THAT DATE RANGE.  BY SETTING THIS FIELD
      *C     TO SPACES; INV, REC, AND DCHG TRANSACTIONS WITH A DOCUMENT
      *C     NUMBER OF "PROC" WERE  BEING EXCLUDED FROM THE REPORT EVEN
      *C     IF THEY FELL WITHIN THE DATE RANGE SPECIFIED.
      *C
      *C   18APR1996   CA YODER   REQ #96-001
      *C     ADDED A SUBTOTAL FOR SR50 REPORT IN LAWTON TO SHOW
      *C     ENGINEERING EXPENSES FOR EACH DEPARTMENT.  ENGINEERING
      *C     EXPENSES HAVE EXPENSE CODES BETWEEN 000001 AND 000099
      *C     AND ALSO INCLUDE CODE 000250.  ALSO ADDED TOTAL LINE
      *C     SHOWING OPERATING EXPENSES (TOTAL VALUE - ENGINEERING
      *C     EXPENSES).
      *C
      *C   13JUN1996   CA YODER
      *C     ADDED CLASSES 254 AND 242 TO THE LIST OF ENGINEERING
      *C     EXPENSE CLASSES FOR LAWTON PER J. SHRADER REQUEST.
      *C     THEY ARE INCLUDED IN 250 FOR THE BODY OF THE REPORT
      *C     BUT NOT FOR THE SUMMARY.
      *C
      *C   03SEP1996   CA YODER
      *C     MODIFIED PROGRAM FOR CENTURY DATABASE CHANGES.
      *C
      *C   30SEP1996   DAVE PLUM
      *C     REVISED PROGRAM TO CAUSE THE SPECIAL LAWTON ONLY LOGIC TO
      *C     APPLY TO UNION CITY ALSO.
      *C
      *C   17DEC1997   CA YODER    REQ #97-016
      *C     ADDED OPTION TO EXCLUDE TRANSACTIONS FOR THE STOREROOM
      *C     DEPARTMENT.
      *C
DP9802*C   23FEB1998   DAVE PLUM
DP9802*C     ADDED LOGIC TO ADVISE THE USER WHEN AN INVALID DATE IS
DP9802*C     INPUT FOR OPT-LOW-DATE AND/OR OPT-HIGH-DATE.
DP9802*C
JC9809*C   17SEP1998   JE COFFMAN
JC9809*C     ADDED LOGIC TO CALL CNDESC WHEN NON-STR ITEM EXISTS
JC9809*C     AND USER NEEDS TO SEE 1ST LINE OF PURCHASE ORDER
JC9809*C     DESCRIPTION INFORMATION. REQUESTED BY RONNIE RHODES
JC9809*C     IN TOPEKA.
JC9809*C
JC9910*C   12OCT1999   JE COFFMAN
JC9910*C     REPAIRED A PROBLEM FOR LAWTON WHERE THEY WERE LOOKING
JC9910*C     FOR RECORDS FOR A SPECIFIC CLOCK CARD BUT THE PROGRAM
JC9910*C     WAS PRODUCING A BOGUS REPORT AS IT WAS INCLUDING BLANK
JC9910*C     EMPLOYEE RECORDS AS WELL.
JC9910*C
DP0401*C  26JAN2004    DAVE PLUM
DP0401*C     EXPANDED THE TC-TOTAL-ARRAY FROM 75 TO 900 ROWS.
DP0401*C
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.  AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.  AS400.
       SPECIAL-NAMES.  C01 IS NEW-PAGE.

       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT PRINT-FILE ASSIGN TO PRINTER-MCPRT.

           SELECT SORT-FILE    ASSIGN TO DISK-SORT.

      *------ SELECT STATEMENTS FOR IBM ONLY ------*
           SELECT DTRANS-MC-I
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCA0701
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                 WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DTRANS2-MC-I
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCA1201
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                 WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DAPPLFRT-FP-I
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCA1104
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                 WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT MPLTINFO-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0501
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT MACCOUNT-INFO-I
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCA0101
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

      *------ SELECT STATEMENTS FOR IBM ONLY ------*

       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.

       FD  PRINT-FILE
           DATA RECORD IS PRINT-REC.
       01  PRINT-REC                PIC X(132).

       SD  SORT-FILE
           DATA RECORD IS SORT-REC.
       01  SORT-REC.
           05  SORT-STORES-CODE          PIC X(8).
           05  SORT-CLASS                PIC X(4).
           05  SORT-DEPT                 PIC X(6).
           05  SORT-ACCT                 PIC X(6).
           05  SORT-PO-NUM.
               10  SORT-ORDER-NUM        PIC X(7).
               10  SORT-RELEASE          PIC X(3).
           05  SORT-RCVR-NUM             PIC X(4).
           05  SORT-ITEM-NUM             PIC X(4).
           05  SORT-CODE                 PIC X(4).
           05  SORT-DATE-CN.
               10  SORT-CC               PIC XX.
               10  SORT-DATE.
                   15  SORT-YY           PIC XX.
                   15  SORT-MM           PIC XX.
                   15  SORT-DD           PIC XX.
           05  SORT-TIME.
               10  SORT-HOURS            PIC XX.
               10  SORT-MINUTES          PIC XX.
               10  SORT-SECONDS          PIC XX.
           05  SORT-EMP                  PIC X(4).
           05  SORT-QTY                  PIC S9(10).
           05  SORT-VALUE                PIC S9(12)V99.
           05  SORT-DOCUMENT-NUM.
               10  SORT-MANIFEST-NO      PIC X(3).
               10  SORT-REGISTER-NO      PIC X(9).
           05  SORT-UNIT-MEASURE         PIC XX.
           05  SORT-BALANCE-QTY          PIC S9(10).
           05  SORT-EXP-CAT              PIC X(1).
           05  SORT-CANCELLED-FLAG       PIC X(1).
           05  SORT-DLVR-CARR            PIC X(4).

      *------ FD STATEMENTS FOR IBM ONLY ------*
       FD  DTRANS-MC-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DTRANS-MC-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCA0700  OF MCFLCA0701.

       FD  DTRANS2-MC-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DTRANS2-MC-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCA1200  OF MCFLCA1201.

       FD  DAPPLFRT-FP-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DAPPLFRT-FP-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCA1100  OF MCFLCA1104.

       FD  MPLTINFO-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MPLTINFO-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS0500  OF MCFLCS0501.

       FD  MACCOUNT-INFO-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MACCOUNT-INFO-I-REC.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCA0100  OF MCFLCA0101.

      *------ FD STATEMENTS FOR IBM ONLY ------*

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

       77  HOLD-DLVR-CARR                PIC X(4).
       77  HOLD-CARRIER                  PIC X(4).
       77  CANCELLED-FLAG                PIC X(1)   VALUE "N".
       77  HANDLE-BLOWUP-FLAG            PIC X(1)   VALUE "Y".
       77  FOUND-IT                      PIC X(1).
       77  EOF-SW                        PIC X(1)   VALUE "N".
